  "description": "Stores the response as the api returns it. The sdk types Attributes as a map of string to string, which means nothing below it can be proven and every path under it is waved through - so a plugin reading Attributes.Policy.Statement saves and then matches nothing. Attributes is declared here as a structure naming what GetQueueAttributes returns, and the v2 runner parses a document held as text when a path reads into it, so the save-time answer and the scan-time data agree. The remaining attributes are text as sqs returns them, including RedrivePolicy and RedriveAllowPolicy, which are json documents in their own right.",
